    "Wrapper groups the installed xfrac sfrac output as one math atom for native unbraced superscripts; every author-body byte/formula is unchanged, initial failed build retained",
    "Native bold-vector macro made robust for moving article headings and mapped to plain text only in PDF bookmarks; original printed mathematical macro/body unchanged, earlier failed build retained"
  ],
